  {
    "id": 4001060020120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あの時見上げていたステージは、私にはとても遠くて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106002/4001060020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060020130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "観客のひとりでしかない私なんて、\r\n紛れてしまうものだと思っていました",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106002/4001060020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060020140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、ステージに立つと違うんです\r\n客席がとても近いんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106002/4001060020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001060020150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "楽しんでくれてそうだな、とか\r\n少し退屈なのかもしれないな、とか",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106002/4001060020150"
